ical value of these fragments lies in highlighting the struggle of some farsighted medieval Arab scholars to define and establish psychology as a medical discipline.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
  Kahl, Oliver. “Love Is a Malady: Remnants of a Lost Arabic Work on Medical Deontology.” <title level="m">Journal of Semitic Studies</title> 64:1 (2019): 185–98.
